# Aggressive ignore — only the bits the build genuinely needs end up in context.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/build
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp

# Anything secret-shaped — never bake into the image
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/credentials.json

# Docs & specs aren't needed at build time
docs/
README.md
*.md
!base/dotfiles-sample/**/*.md
